Code Shape Meaning <code>400</code> <code>ErrorResponse</code> Malformed JSON body. <code>401</code> <code>ErrorResponse</code> Missing / invalid bearer token. <code>408</code> <code>ErrorResponse</code> Request timeout (configurable in Settings). <code>413</code> <code>ErrorResponse</code> Prompt or body exceeds the configured cap. <code>429</code> <code>ErrorResponse</code> + <code>Retry-After: 5</code> Queue full (default 8 in flight). <code>500</code> <code>ErrorResponse</code> Server / engine error. <p><code>ErrorResponse</code> schema:</p> <pre><code>{ "error": { "message": "Inference timeout", "type": "timeout", "code": 408 } }
</code></pre> <p>Errors mid-stream are delivered as a final SSE chunk + the <code>[DONE]</code> sentinel — never as a silently-closed connection:</p> <pre><code>data: {"error":{"message":"Inference timeout","type":"timeout","code":408}}

data: [DONE]
</code></pre>
